    note for InspectionQueries "CHANGE 1.0.3: getFormResponsesBySite removes answers that the steward hides.<br>CHANGE 7.0.4: it also returns the question key of each answer.<br>The site page groups answers by that key. There is no separate query."
    note for AccessChecks "Not a module. Each helper is a private function that reads the caller from the server session.<br>requireApprovedAdmin: queries.ts and form-actions.ts. requireApprovedCaller, requireReportWriter: queries.ts.<br>isApprovedAdmin: admin-actions.ts and kml-import-actions.ts. getAdminUserId: steward-actions.ts.<br>Approved = app_metadata.authenticated true. Admin = app_metadata.role admin. RLS reads the same keys.<br>The route handlers have inline copies. middleware.ts also blocks unapproved users (403 or redirect to /sites)."
    note for SiteQueries "US 2.0.8 uses Site, getSiteByName and getFormResponsesBySite.<br>US 2.0.4: archiveSite hides a Site. permanentlyDeleteSite deletes only an archived sites_pa row.<br>SIRs, attachments and homepage images stay with no site. S3 files stay.<br>US 2.0.1: getProtectedAreaBoundaries. US 2.0.2: getSiteSuggestions."
    note for ExportRoutes "POST /api/export makes a job and starts processExportJob after the response.<br>GET /api/export/status/[jobId] returns the URL only to an Admin or the job creator.<br>The ZIP includes inspection images, homepage images, GPX files and completed PDFs, up to 500 MB."
    note for PdfDataFetcher "CHANGE 7.0.7: removes the answers of options.hiddenQuestionIds.<br>CHANGE 7.0.6: processPdfJob reads the SIRs in batches.<br>The cause of the 50 SIR limit is an open question."
    note for ContributionMetrics "Proposed (docs/user-model.md, Gamification proposal). Counts from form_responses and sites_pa:<br>inspections, counties, site variety, first report of a Site. All time or the last year.<br>No points are stored. people.activity_points stays unused."
    note for NewReportPage "NEW 4.0.5: the browser calls iNaturalist. handleSubmit copies<br>each chosen photo to S3 through /api/s3/presign.<br>insertInspectionAttachments writes inat_observation_id.<br>CHANGE 4.0.6: photo identifier is optional and does not block submission.<br>PresignRoute also accepts an empty identifier."
    note for GeocodeRoute "US 6.0.1 AT 4: results are cached and requests stay under 2,500 per day.<br>Open question: where the cache and the daily count are stored."

